  10: Priority order the implementation must satisfy for :func:`model_root`:
  11:   1. DESKPET_MODEL_ROOT env var
  12:   2. user_models_dir() if it exists on disk (LocalAppData on Windows)
  13:   3. sys._MEIPASS if set (PyInstaller runtime marker)
  14:   4. backend/models/ relative to paths.py (dev mode)
