 253: def user_log_dir() -> Path:
 254:     """User log directory.
 255: 
 256:     Portable: ``<install_dir>/userdata/logs``.
 257:     Classic:  ``user_data_dir() / "logs"`` (under %AppData% on Windows).
 258: 
 259:     We deliberately put logs alongside the rest of the user data
 260:     (rather than the platformdirs ``user_log_dir`` default of a
 261:     separate "Logs" subtree) so support bundles capture them in one
 262:     place.
 263: 
 264:     Override via ``DESKPET_USER_LOG_DIR``.
 265:     """
